d fact registries beyond the\n66|  Section 13.14.1 envelope in `checkPayload` (normalization sibling),\n67|  including non-message payload numbers.\n68|- `maximal_safe` projection planning past\n69|  `RefuseMaximalSafeUnlessComplete` (projection sibling).\n70|- Target-branch (G2) admission past `RefuseUnstableForTarget`.\n71|- Section 7.8 capture-plan/capture/normalize operation wiring\n72|  (stays `sessadapter`-owned).\n73|- `-0`/`+n`/leading-zero extension literals admit by\n74|  `canonicaljson.validateAXNumbers` parity.\n75|- `internal/traceability` registry bindings and digest re-pin\n76|  (Story FINAL leaf).","final_result":true}}}
