og` |\n55|| P2-e IdentityDigest seals undecodable | re-decode before hashing (as `buildCaptureManifest` does) | `TestIdentityDigestRefusals` (bad kind, bad ext key, opaque, session) | `mutants/run2/N-identity-rededecode.log` |\n56|| P3-a sanitizer scope | hardened: `unicode.IsControl` (C1), Cf/Zl/Zp invisible marks, case-folded AX marker, schemeless password-colon; exact bound in code comment + TRACEABILITY.md | `TestIdentityRefusals/sanitizer` corpus (+U+0085/U+2028/U+200B/URN:AX:/userinfo rows) | `mutants/run2/N-sanitizer-control.log`, `pkg-test.log` |\n57|| P3-b content blocks | XOR enforced: exactly one of content/descriptor | `block_neither_content_nor_descriptor`, `block_both_content_and_descriptor` rows | `mutants/run2/N-block-xor.log` |\n58|| P3-c items != plan sealed | `checkPlanItemMatch` refuses at build; raw-half incompleteness still seals with `raw_complete=false` | `TestCaptureManifestRefusals/build_plan_match` (extra/missing/renamed) | `mutants/run2/N-plan-item-match.log` |\n59|| P3-d N-exclusion-config delete | replaced with a true narrowing (admits exactly `settings.bak.3`) | `TestRawManifestExcludesTrustMaterial` | `mutants/run2/N-exclusion-config.log` |\n60|| P3-e verdict-only log | harness `--log-dir` writes one raw log per plant with subprocess exit | harness itself | `mutants/run2/*.log`, `mutants/run3/*.log` (37 logs each) |\n61|| P3-f LOGBOOK sentence | fixed: production calls neither `VerifyObjectIdentity` (only the fixture does); `CalculateObjectIdentity` + local comparisons | text | `LOGBOOK.md` diff |\n62|| P3-g Core nominal | stated in `BoundaryInput` comment + TRACEABILITY.md: real protection is `RefuseUnstableForTarget` | text | `boundary.go`, `TRACEABILITY.md` |\n63|| P3-h dead code | removed `_ = extensionBytes`, `_ = manifest`, `_ = workspace`, `kindOf`, wrong-unit comment | `go vet`, suite | `cmd03.log`, `pkg-test.log` |\n64|\n65|## AC coverage: 18 of 18 rows driven\n66|\n67|See `TASK-260830-24z2b3_conformance-matrix.md` (rev3): every row\n68|names its production call site and driving test. New/strengthened\n69|rows since rev2: 4 (sanitizer bound), 6 (decode item rules),\n70|7 (decode class rule), 10 (dup keys, plan match), 12/13 (decode\n71|unions), 15 (identity re-decode), 16/17 (decode actor/event rules),\n72|18 (identity link, verifier/install negatives).\n73|\n74|## Validation reran in attempt 3 (this run, final tree)\n75|\n76|- Commands 1-3 (`gofmt` check, `go build ./...`, `go vet ./...`):\n77|  PASS (`cmd01.log`, `cmd02.log`, `cmd03.log`)\n78|- Command 4 (`go test ./... -count=1 -v`): PASS\n79|  (`cmd04.log`)\n80|- Command 5 (`go test ./... -race -count=1 -timeout 25m`): PASS\n81|  (`cmd05.log`)\n82|- Command 6 (`go test ./... -cover -count=1`): PASS\n83|  (`cmd06.log`)\n84|- Commands 7-20 (fuzz smokes, 14 targets): PASS\n85|  (`cmd07-20.log`)\n86|- Commands 21-22 (`tracecheck`, `cataloggen -adopted -check`):\n87|  PASS (`cmd21-22.log`)\n88|- Commands 23-24 (`GOOS=linux/windows` builds): PASS\n89|  (`cmd23-24.log`)\n90|- Commands 25-27 (JSON validation, `task-board validate`,\n91|  `git diff --check`): PASS (`cmd25-27.log`)\n92|- Package suite: PASS, 83.9% statements (`pkg-test.log`,\n93|  `pkg-cover.log`); package race PASS (`pkg-race.log`)\n94|- Mutant harness: 36 KILLED + 1 SURVIVED control, full battery run\n95|  twice with per-plant raw logs (`mutants/run2/*.log`,\n96|  `mutants/run3/*.log`, `mutants.log`), `PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1`,\n97|  no `__pycache__`\n98|- No `internal/traceability` edit; candidate paths only in\n99|  `git status` (plus the pre-existing untracked package dir)\n100|- Note: after commands 4-6 completed, a doc-comment placement slip\n101|  (two comment lines attached to the neighboring function) was\n102|  fixed; the delta is comment-only. Re-verified on the final tree:\n103|  package suite PASS, `go vet` clean, `gofmt` clean,\n104|  `git diff --check` clean, `N-plan-item-match` + `N-excluded-exact`\n105|  KILLED (`final-tree.log`).\n106|\n107|## Bounds for siblings (not waived)\n108|\n109|- Per-kind event payload fact registries past the envelope,\n110|  including non-message payload numbers (normalization sibling).\n111|- `maximal_safe` projection planning past\n112|  `RefuseMaximalSafeUnlessComplete` (projection sibling).\n113|- Target-branch (G2) admission past `RefuseUnstableForTarget`.\n114|- Section 7.8 operation wiring (stays `sessadapter`).\n115|- `-0`/`+n`/leading-zero extension literals admit by\n116|  `canonicaljson.validateAXNumbers` parity (stated, not waived).\n117|- `internal/traceability` bindings + re-pin (FINAL leaf).\n118|\n119|## Attachments\n120|\n121|- `TASK-260830-24z2b3_conformance-matrix.md` (rev3)\n122|- `TASK-260830-24z2b3_producer-evidence.tar.gz` (attempt-3 logs:\n123|  27-command suite, package suite, 2x36+1 mutant battery with\n124|  per-plant logs, file manifest)","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"read_file","outcome":"success"}}}
