{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c9eb","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0b144-2d0b-7f30-96a3-e7fabafc632c"},"sequence":848,"recorded_at":1780531400001691,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"96a3132b-8530-4e47-8657-36d15f2da569","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"96a3132b-8530-4e47-8657-36d15f2da569","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"96a3132b-8530-4e47-8657-36d15f2da569"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0b147-e1ab-76c1-aa10-382579ed6701"},"task_id":"01a0b147-e1ab-76c1-aa10-382579ed6701","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0b147-e1ab-76c1-aa10-382579ed6701","chunk":"edited\nchanged lines: lines 6-8\n--- original\n+++ updated\n@@\n-## 2026-09-17\n-\n-### TASK-260917-10k118: reconstructed the reviewed v0.7.0 adoption on trunk 7efe385 (STORY-260916-3uqbwq unlandable, accepted CRs frozen)\n+## 2026-09-17\n+\n+### TASK-260830-24z2b3 — clone bundle + canonical session/event types (first leaf)\n+\n+- DELIVERED: `internal/clonebundle` implements the Section 13.14.1 capture contracts over the landed owners — Clone Raw Object Manifest 1.0.0, Clone Capture Manifest 1.0.0 (Capture Items, Source Basis, Capture Boundary, core-derived `raw_complete`), Canonical Session 1.0.0 + Actors, Canonical Event 1.0.0 (Source Evidence, raw refs, content blocks), NativeIdentity/WorkspaceBinding, immutable generations — plus Section 10.2 descriptor agreement and no-replace install via `localstore`. Every Build entry is byte-identical for identical inputs; every Decode entry enforces the closed shape. Row-21 exclusion allowlist (`hosttrust` matchers) enforced at raw-entry and capture-item construction with per-class negatives.\n+- OWNERSHIP: `canonicaljson` keeps its `rejectUnsupportedImmutableObjectShape` rows (that table's census pins every row); this package is the validating owner and reuses `Canonicalize` (byte transform), `CalculateObjectIdentity` plus local claim comparisons (blobs; never the attesting `VerifyObjectIdentity` entry — only the test fixture calls it — per the provhost no-attestation bound), `sessadapter.DecodeTuple`, the `environ` scalar gate set via delegating wrappers, `scalar`, `hosttrust`, and `localstore.PutBlob`. No `internal/traceability` edit (FINAL leaf carries bindings + re-pin); clause map in `internal/clonebundle/TRACEABILITY.md`.\n+- EVIDENCE: package suite green (83.9% statements), 36 narrowing mutants KILLED + harmless control SURVIVED (`testdata/mutant_harness.py --log-dir`, one raw log per plant with subprocess exit, `PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1`, no `__pycache__`); `TestInstallRawBlobIsIdempotent` + `TestInstallRawBlobRefusals` prove the localstore delegation (double install agrees; forged claim, short/long/tampered bytes refuse); durability itself is the landed localstore discipline (purity bound for this package: no second write path). README package section added with test commands and no capability claim.\n+- REV3 (rework of review RUN-260917-c05bc8): P1-a descriptor identity linked to the entry at build + evidence verification; P1-b AX number model + nested-duplicate refusal on extension values at build + decode; P2-f/P2-a environ gate adoption with the character string measure; P2-b/P2-c decode-side negatives for every surviving row + verifier/install negatives with per-plant logs; P2-d duplicate raw keys refused; P2-e identity re-decode before hashing; P3-b content XOR enforced; P3-c one-per-plan-candidate refused at build; P3-a sanitizer hardened with the exact bound stated; P3-d/P3-e harness rows fixed; P3-f/g/h hygiene. Finding-by-finding table in `TASK-260830-24z2b3_results.md`.\n+- BOUNDS (sibling scope, not waived): per-kind event payload fact registries past the envelope (incl. non-message payload numbers); `maximal_safe` planning past the refusal gate; G2 admission past `RefuseUnstableForTarget`; Section 7.8 operation wiring (stays `sessadapter`). Candidate UNCOMMITTED in the Story worktree.\n+- AC: 18 of 18 rows driven through production entries by named tests (matrix in `TASK-260830-24z2b3_conformance-matrix.md`).\n+\n+### TASK-260917-10k118: reconstructed the reviewed v0.7.0 adoption on trunk 7efe385 (STORY-260916-3uqbwq unlandable, accepted CRs frozen)\n","final_result":true}}}
