{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000ccef","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0b144-2d0b-7f30-96a3-e7fabafc632c"},"sequence":1234,"recorded_at":1780531400002463,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"96a3132b-8530-4e47-8657-36d15f2da569","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"96a3132b-8530-4e47-8657-36d15f2da569","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"96a3132b-8530-4e47-8657-36d15f2da569"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0b14a-6edd-7181-8611-74aecabcc1cb"},"task_id":"01a0b14a-6edd-7181-8611-74aecabcc1cb","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0b14a-6edd-7181-8611-74aecabcc1cb","chunk":"Read text file `internal/clonebundle/testdata/mutant_harness.py`.\n1|#!/usr/bin/env python3\n2|\"\"\"Narrowing-mutant harness for internal/clonebundle.\n3|\n4|Every gate ships a narrowing mutant: the gate stays present and is\n5|weakened to admit exactly one member of the class it must reject, and\n6|the named killer test must fail. A delete-only mutant proves only that\n7|the gate exists and is not accepted as evidence.\n8|\n9|Each row runs M (mutate one production file in place), R (run the\n10|scoped Go killer through the production entry point), V (verdict from\n11|the Go exit code plus a FAIL kill-line: KILLED iff R fails with a test\n12|failure line, SURVIVED iff R passes, ERROR for anything else —\n13|unapplied patches, build breaks, timeouts). M failures and R\n14|infrastructure errors are ERROR, never kills or survivals. The file is\n15|restored from its backup after every row, pass or fail.\n16|\n17|Row C-doc-comment is the harmless control: a comment-only edit that\n18|must SURVIVE, proving the harness observes test outcomes instead of\n19|hard-coding kills.\n20|\n21|Usage:\n22|  PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 python3 internal/clonebundle/testdata/mutant_harness.py [--log-dir DIR] [MUTANT ...]\n23|\"\"\"\n24|\n25|import shutil\n26|import subprocess\n27|import sys\n28|import tempfile\n29|import time\n30|from dataclasses import dataclass\n31|from pathlib import Path\n32|\n33|REPO = Path(__file__).resolve().parents[3]\n34|PACKAGE = \"internal/clonebundle\"\n35|\n36|FORGED_DESCRIPTOR_HEX = \"edb3da2954b883ebc2099da18edeac4e12f8f5d67aa5bb2dd80ba472b23481f2\"\n37|OTHER_DESCRIPTOR_HEX = \"369c0225affac23e2a7a16052d03b24bfd9421ea3f83c8fe39111e864c344cfb\"\n38|PAIR_DIGEST = \"sha256:305e10453577c8371cdb872e120f1662649d150bbc2eff62b81827851f1d4926\"\n39|\n40|\n41|@dataclass(frozen=True)\n42|class Mutant:\n43|    name: str\n44|    path: str\n45|    find: str\n46|    replace: str\n47|    count: int\n48|    run: str\n49|    expect: str\n50|    note: str\n51|\n52|\n53|MUTANTS = [\n54|    Mutant(\n55|        name=\"N-raw-class\",\n56|        path=f\"{PACKAGE}/rawmanifest.go\",\n57|        find='\\t\"derived_cache_optional\",\\n\\t\"unknown\",\\n',\n58|        replace='\\t\"derived_cache_optional\",\\n\\t\"credential\",\\n\\t\"unknown\",\\n',\n59|        count=1,\n60|        run=\"TestRawManifestRefusals/build/credential_forbidden\",\n61|        expect=\"KILLED\",\n62|        note=\"Admits exactly credential into the raw subset; every other excluded class still refuses.\",\n63|    ),\n64|    Mutant(\n65|        name=\"N-raw-order\",\n66|        path=f\"{PACKAGE}/rawmanifest.go\",\n67|        find=\"\\tif index > 0 && input.NativeItemKey <= previous {\\n\",\n68|        replace=\"\\tif index > 0 && input.NativeItemKey < previous {\\n\",\n69|        count=1,\n70|        run=\"TestRawManifestRefusals/build/duplicate_entries\",\n71|        expect=\"KILLED\",\n72|        note=\"Admits exactly duplicate keys; unsorted keys still refuse.\",\n73|    ),\n74|    Mutant(\n75|        name=\"N-exclusion-config\",\n76|        path=f\"{PACKAGE}/rawmanifest.go\",\n77|        find=\"\\tif hosttrust.ExcludedConfigDirName(key) {\\n\",\n78|        replace='\\tif hosttrust.ExcludedConfigDirName(key) && key != \"settings.bak.3\" {\\n',\n79|        count=1,\n80|        run=\"TestRawManifestExcludesTrustMaterial\",\n81|        expect=\"KILLED\",\n82|        note=\"Admits exactly the settings.bak.3 config key; every other excluded key still refuses. Token preserved.\",\n83|    ),\n84|    Mutant(\n85|        name=\"N-sanitize-uuid\",\n86|        path=f\"{PACKAGE}/identity.go\",\n87|        find=\"\\tif _, err := scalar.ParseUUIDv7(key); err == nil {\\n\",\n88|        replace='\\tif _, err := scalar.ParseUUIDv7(key); err == nil && key != \"0198f4c8-8e50-7f66-8f70-1234567890c2\" {\\n',\n89|        count=1,\n90|        run=\"TestIdentityRefusals/sanitizer\",\n91|        expect=\"KILLED\",\n92|        note=\"Admits exactly one UUIDv7 native key; every other UUIDv7 still refuses. Token preserved.\",\n93|    ),\n94|    Mutant(\n95|        name=\"N-sanitizer-control\",\n96|        path=f\"{PACKAGE}/identity.go\",\n97|        find=\"\\t\\tif unicode.IsControl(unit) {\\n\",\n98|        replace=\"\\t\\tif unicode.IsControl(unit) && unit != 0x1f {\\n\",\n99|        count=1,\n100|        run=\"TestIdentityRefusals/sanitizer\",\n101|        expect=\"KILLED\",\n102|        note=\"Admits exactly U+001F; every other control still refuses.\",\n103|    ),\n104|    Mutant(\n105|        name=\"N-always-excluded\",\n106|        path=f\"{PACKAGE}/captureitem.go\",\n107|        find='\\tcase \"credential\", \"machine_auth\", \"runtime_state\", \"transient_lock\":\\n',\n108|        replace='\\tcase \"machine_auth\", \"runtime_state\", \"transient_lock\":\\n',\n109|        count=1,\n110|        run=\"TestCaptureItemRefusals/credential_included\",\n111|        expect=\"KILLED\",\n112|        note=\"Admits exactly included credential rows; the other three always-excluded classes still refuse.\",\n113|    ),\n114|    Mutant(\n115|        name=\"N-included-reason\",\n116|        path=f\"{PACKAGE}/captureitem.go\",\n117|        find=\"\\t\\tif hasReason {\\n\",\n118|        replace='\\t\\tif hasReason && class == \"unknown\" {\\n',\n119|        count=1,\n120|        run=\"TestCaptureItemRefusals/included_with_reason\",\n121|        expect=\"KILLED\",\n122|        note=\"Admits exactly non-unknown included rows with a reason; the killer uses durable_payload.\",\n123|    ),\n124|    Mutant(\n125|        name=\"N-unknown-complete\",\n126|        path=f\"{PACKAGE}/capturebuild.go\",\n127|        find=\"\\tif hasUnknownClass(items) {\\n\",\n128|        replace=\"\\tif hasUnknownClass(items) && len(items) > 4 {\\n\",\n129|        count=1,\n130|        run=\"TestBuildCaptureManifestUnknownMakesIncomplete\",\n131|        expect=\"KILLED\",\n132|        note=\"Admits exactly small unknown-class manifests as complete; the 4-item killer derives true.\",\n133|    ),\n134|    Mutant(\n135|        name=\"N-excluded-exact\",\n136|        path=f\"{PACKAGE}/capturebuild.go\",\n137|        find=\"\\tif len(derived) != len(excluded) {\\n\",\n138|        replace=\"\\tif len(derived) > len(excluded) {\\n\",\n139|        count=1,\n140|        run=\"TestExcludedClassesExactGate\",\n141|        expect=\"KILLED\",\n142|        note=\"Admits exactly superset excluded_classes; missing classes still refuse.\",\n143|    ),\n144|    Mutant(\n145|        name=\"N-proof-identity\",\n146|        path=f\"{PACKAGE}/boundary.go\",\n147|        find=\"\\t\\tif proof.SnapshotIdentity != nil {\\n\",\n148|        replace='\\t\\tif proof.SnapshotIdentity != nil && proof.ProofKind != \"closed_store\" {\\n',\n149|        count=1,\n150|        run=\"TestBoundaryRefusals/decode_stable_proof/closed_store_with_identity\",\n151|        expect=\"KILLED\",\n152|        note=\"Admits exactly closed_store with an identity; provider_quiescence still refuses one.\",\n153|    ),\n154|    Mutant(\n155|        name=\"N-core-only\",\n156|        path=f\"{PACKAGE}/boundary.go\",\n157|        find=\"\\t\\tif !input.Core {\\n\",\n158|        replace='\\t\\tif !input.Core && input.Generation != \"g\" {\\n',\n159|        count=1,\n160|        run=\"TestBoundaryRefusals/build_c